                <h2 id="world-Highlight">Enemy Implementation</h2>
                <p>
                    I integrated two enemy types by importing meshes and
                    animations, building a scalable framework using inheritance
                    for easy expansion. An AI system powered by behavior trees
                    enables dynamic, decision-based behavior, with strategically
                    triggered abilities programmed directly into the tree. This
                    structured approach ensures both flexibility and depth in
                    enemy design.
                </p>

