                <p>
                    Implemented the new Unity Input System to support flexible,
                    scalable input handling across keyboard and mouse. This
                    newer system allowed for clean input mapping, easier device
                    support, and improved control responsiveness, enhancing
                    overall player experience and future-proofing the input
                    architecture.
