                    Designed a set of six diverse player abilities, balancing
                    offensive and defensive gameplay. Introduced a rechargeable
                    shield that regenerates over time to protect player health,
                    and implemented a heat system for the primary weapon to
                    prevent overuse through an overheating mechanic.
                </p>

